    <string name="settings_ai_mode_direct">Directly, with your API key</string>
    <string name="settings_ai_mode_proxy">Through the app\'s server</string>
    <string name="settings_ai_mode_direct_note">Requests go from this phone straight to Anthropic\'s Claude API with your own API key. Usage is billed to your key.</string>
    <string name="settings_ai_mode_proxy_note">Requests pass through the app\'s server to Anthropic\'s Claude API. The server does not keep the text.</string>
    <string name="settings_ai_sent_title">What is sent</string>
    <string name="settings_ai_sent">To fill in a task, the app sends: the task text and the fields already recognised; the language; the current date, time and time zone; your S, M and L durations; up to 5 similar completed tasks (text, size and time spent). Notes, context snapshots and history are never sent.</string>
